    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 55 Ard na Mara is an attractive, detached two storey residence which enjoys a pleasant setting within a mature, low density, residential development in the seaside village of Blackrock, Co. Louth.\n\nThis spacious home extending to approx. 159 sq.m. / 1,711 sq.ft. offers a light filled interior throughout with rooms of generous proportion and well-appointed accommodation. On entering this home, there is a welcoming entrance hall, formal sitting room, generous sized living room opening into the dining room, kitchen, utility, four bedrooms (1 ensuite) and a main bathroom - perfect versatile accommodation suited to family life and those looking to downsize. The enclosed, private, southerly facing rear garden offers the ideal orientation for al fresco dining.\n\nArd na Mara is a much sought-after residential development, conveniently positioned close to the heart of Blackrock Village. Blackrock is located mid-way between Dublin and Belfast along the M1 Corridor and was previously voted as one of the “Top 20 Places to Live” in Ireland. Fronting the shores of Dundalk Bay, Blackrock has developed into a village of choice, offering a superb lifestyle for individuals and families alike and is host to a wide range of restaurants, gourmet cafes and bespoke artisan outlets fronting onto Blackrock Promenade and Beach. In addition, the location benefits from two primary schools, Blackrock Park, GAA and football clubs, Dundalk Golf Club, sea swimming and a Community Centre offering a varied selection of recreational options to all age ranges.\n\nNearby Dundalk Town offers a host of additional services and amenities including DkIT, Marshes Shopping Centre, Dundalk Retail Park, and IDA Business & Technology Parks which play host to numerous multi-national companies such as WuXi Biologics/MSD, Anord Mardix, Prometric, PCI Pharma, Almac and many more. \n\nThis home will appeal to those seeking a private, comfortable residence, in a quiet location. Viewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nSitting Room - 4.8m x 4.2m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.2m x 3.7m\n\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.2m x 3.5m\n\n\nUtility Room - 3.6m x 2.0m\n\n\nBoiler Room - 1.4m x 1.3m\n\n\nWC - 2.3m x 1.3m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.8m x 3.4m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.8m x 3.4m\n\n\nEn-Suite - 3.4m x 1.2m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.7m x 1.9m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.2m x 2.9m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.7m x 3.7m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.7m x 2.6m\n\n\n - \nTOTAL FLOOR AREA: 1717 sq.ft. (159.5 sq.m.) approx.\n\n"
